  /* Tags for every book, from the spreadsheet's own tag column.

     A tag is only kept when it could narrow a search of the store: it has to be
     on two books or more, since one book is found by its own name; on 15% of the
     catalogue or fewer, since a tag on half the books narrows nothing; and it
     must say something the title does not say already.

     That is why there is no Strong Female here, and no Dragon on a book with a
     dragon in its name. Fewer, and each one worth clicking.

     Nothing is printed under a title: the tags feed the search box, so a book
     carries every tag that fits it rather than the handful that would look tidy
     on the page.

     Also left out: how explicit a book is, since the badge beside these says
     that, and the production notes about word count and paperbacks.

     A "Tags:" line in a product's own description wins over this list. */
